      "citation_precision": null,
      "mode": "hybrid",
      "answer": "**Main idea**\n\nThe paper introduces the **Transformer**, a new neural network architecture for sequence\u2011to\u2011sequence tasks that **eliminates recurrence and convolution entirely** and relies **only on attention mechanisms** (specifically scaled dot\u2011product and multi\u2011head self\u2011attention). This design enables far greater parallelisation, faster training, and state\u2011of\u2011the\u2011art translation performance.",
